%% View 3 — Alur data: user tenant-a membuat tiket (target M2)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as usera (tenant-a)
  participant KC as Keycloak (OIDC)
  participant ING as Traefik Ingress
  participant API as CampusDesk API (pod)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>KC: login (realm capstone)
  KC-->>U: access token (realm_access.roles = user, groups = /tenant-a)
  U->>ING: POST /api/tickets + Bearer token  [B1]
  ING->>API: teruskan request  [B2]
  API->>API: validasi JWT (issuer, signature, exp) via JWKS Keycloak  [B3]
  alt token tidak ada / tidak valid
    API-->>U: 401
  else role tidak sesuai
    API-->>U: 403
  end
  API->>API: TenantContext = tenant-a (dari klaim groups, BUKAN dari input)
  API->>DB: SELECT sla_policy WHERE priority = ?  [B5]
  API->>DB: INSERT tickets (tenant_id = tenant-a, response_due_at, resolve_due_at)  [B4]
  DB-->>API: id tiket
  API-->>U: 201 + DTO tiket
  Note over API,DB: GET tiket tenant-b oleh usera → filter tenant terpusat → 404 (QS1)
